  <description value="Proposal: LOINC codes of the microbiology request 'Microscopy: Specific microscopy — ordinal threshold presence by microscopy or staining technique', computed by ECL over the LOINC Ontology 2026-10-21. Object sought and stain named in the code, result is the detection (LOINC PrThr + Ord + stain). Host cells (leukocytes, erythrocytes, epithelia) are included because the technique, not a class, selects. Parts: LOINC enumeration (331, LOINC 2.83), LOINC Ontology observables without LOINC code (0), and the ECL as an intensional include. ECL: `&lt;&lt; 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = (118589004 |Threshold (property) (qualifier value)| OR 705057003 |Presence (property) (qualifier value)|), 370132008 |Scale type (attribute)| = 117363000 |Ordinal value (qualifier value)|, 246501002 |Technique (attribute)| = (&lt;&lt; 278289002 |Microscopy technique (qualifier value)| OR &lt;&lt; 703857004 |Staining technique (qualifier value)|)`"/>
